# Project Foundation

Do not preload the files below. Open one only when the task needs it.

## Source of truth (on demand)

1. User request and attached context.
2. `AGENTS.md` (live contract) and `.cursor/rules/optimization.mdc` (always-on budget).
3. Domain on demand: `library-contracts.mdc`, `design-tokens.mdc`, `model-pair.mdc`, `network.mdc` / `debugging.mdc`.
4. Governance if amending process: `.memories/Constitution.md`.
5. Resume a pass: `.progress/<project>/STATE.json`, then the active ledger.
6. Do not edit `.cursor/{plans,context}/**` mirrors; edit the real file once.

## Operating contract

- Audit the touched surface, then patch. No blind edits.
- Prefer one canonical implementation.
- Do not conflate Endpoint URL, direct target URL, AirPad URL, and destination client ID.
- Verify proportionally; skip tests/reviews unless needed or requested.

## Private data

Never put passwords, tokens, keys, or private access values in docs, rules, `.specify`, `.memories`, logs, or replies. Link `private/connectivity.md` by path only.
